  "sourceTitle": "Glazed Turnips",
  "sourceText": "Glazed Turnips\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, February 12, 2010 - 3:11am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\npound Turnips, diced\n2 tablespoons Butter\n6 tablespoons Dark Karo syrup\ncup Sugar\n1 teaspoon Cinnamon\n1 teaspoon Nutmeg\n1 teaspoon Ground cloves\ncup Water\ncup Chablis\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Drop turnips in boiling water to cover. Simmer until tender; drain. Combine remaining ingredients in saucepan. Heat to boiling. Pour over cooked turnips. Stir and serve.",
